Package: cipher-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Depends: hyprland (>= 0.54), quickshell (>= 0.3), hypridle, hyprpolkitagent,
 xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk,
 qml6-module-qtqml, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
 qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript,
 qt6-svg-plugins, qt6-wayland,
 python3, foot, fonts-jetbrains-mono, fonts-noto-color-emoji,
 pipewire, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, network-manager, upower,
 brightnessctl, playerctl, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, libnotify-bin, xdg-utils
Recommends: hyprlock, cliphist, udiskie, power-profiles-daemon, pavucontrol, blueman,
 wf-recorder, hyprpicker, btop, thunar, chromium, plymouth,
 gnome-themes-extra, qt6-image-formats-plugins, nano
Suggests: gdm3 | greetd, gnome-core
Description: Cipher desktop — Hyprland with a Quickshell desktop shell
 Cipher is a Debian-based Hyprland desktop in the spirit of Omarchy 4:
 one Quickshell process provides the bar, unified app/command menu,
 theme switcher, notifications, on-screen displays, background and
 lock screen. Themes re-color Hyprland, the shell, foot and btop live.
